{
  "episode_id": "S03E04",
  "season_num": 3,
  "episode_num": 4,
  "title": "Episode 4 - Fish Out Of Water",
  "lines": [
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Why do I have to go to this thing?",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "If we want to be a legitimate awards contender,",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Secretariat needs to make an appearance at a big festival.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-I can't just go to Cannes? -You Cannes not.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Apparently, the French do not care for you ever since you said that thing in the press.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hey, I stand by my critique of Sartre.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "His philosophical arguments helped tyrannical regimes justify overt cruelty.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Also, the French smell and I hate them.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And you can't go to Sundance because Robert Redford hates you.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Someone had to tell him The Horse Whisperer was offensive.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Sorry, but real horses don't just do whatever someone says.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And that's why you need to go to this festival.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "[sighs]",
      "type": "stage_direction"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "If you say so.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The Pacific Ocean Film Fest, or POFF, is the biggest underwater film festival in the world.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You make a splash there, people are going to notice.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Fine.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:00:59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "All you need to do is get to the premiere on time, 8:00.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:02",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Walk the red carpet, wave at the crowd, kiss some fish babies.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:06",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "[groans]",
      "type": "stage_direction"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:06",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Fish. They're so annoying.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:08",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:08",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "[squeaking]",
      "type": "stage_direction"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:08",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-Sorry, lady. No habla fish talk.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You need to be sensitive to their culture. Things are different down there.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You know what a thumb's up means, right?",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, I know what a thumb's up means. I'll be fine.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh, I wanted to warn you.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Kelsey Jannings is also going to be at the festival.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-Kelsey? No. -She has another film there.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I haven't talked to her since she got fired from Secretariat.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, luckily you won't have to talk much because you'll both be underwater.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "God, I haven't been underwater since my mother tried to drown me in the bathtub when I was 22.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I can't do this, Ana. I'm sorry.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-Sir. -I'm getting off.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You can't. We've already pressurized the cabin.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-Sir, please return to your seat. -No. I don't want to do this.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You can't make me.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I'm a land creature. I don't belong down there.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You can lead me to water, but you cannot make--",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "00:01:54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "-",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
